<title>USA: Seligman Quality Municipal sets payouts.</title>
<headline>Seligman Quality Municipal sets payouts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		$0.0782		    $0.782</p>
<p> Pay		  March 27</p>
<p> Record	     March 17</p>
<p>NOTE: Seligman Quality Municipal Fund Inc said that in addition to the regular monthly dividend of $0.0782 per share, the company also set a long term capital gains distribution of $0.154 per share.</p>
